Speak of the devil... our new sec-trooper.

::The older man fixes his glasses before inviting you further in.::

Do come in... $(context.player.Name), was it? Come in. I am Edward Oldfield, professor of Supercorporation History at the University of Dis. Also the man responsible for this whole expedition - or so I've been told. ::A smile peeks through his mustache.::&lt;end&gt;

